---
---

<section class="about-section section-padding" id="about" aria-label="About Maryem Essam">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="about-header reveal-item">
      <span class="section-tag">
        <span class="tag-star">✦</span> PROFILE &amp; PHILOSOPHY
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        A LITTLE ABOUT THE PERSON <br />
        <span class="font-serif-italic">behind the posts.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Magazine Split Layout -->
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Editorial Portrait & Pull Quote -->
      <div class="about-visual reveal-item reveal-stagger-1">
        <div class="editorial-portrait-card">
          <div class="card-inner">
            <!-- Editorial Identity Dossier Card -->
            <div class="creator-specimen-box">
              <div class="specimen-header">
                <span class="specimen-code">SPEC_ID // 01</span>
                <span class="specimen-brand">THE SOCIAL EDIT</span>
              </div>

              <div class="specimen-centerpiece">
                <div class="specimen-monogram-seal">
                  <span class="seal-letters">ME</span>
                  <span class="seal-sparkle">✦</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="specimen-name">MARYEM ESSAM</h3>
                <span class="specimen-role-pill">SOCIAL MEDIA SPECIALIST &amp; MODERATOR</span>
              </div>

              <div class="specimen-credentials-list">
                <div class="specimen-cred-item">
                  <span class="cred-icon">🎓</span>
                  <span class="cred-text">Faculty of Commerce — Benha University</span>
                </div>
                <div class="specimen-cred-item">
                  <span class="cred-icon">📜</span>
                  <span class="cred-text">Marketing Scale Set Certification</span>
                </div>
                <div class="specimen-cred-item">
                  <span class="cred-icon">🛍️</span>
                  <span class="cred-text">Sales Experience — SHEIN Platform</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Hand-drawn Style SVG Badge -->
            <div class="badge-quote">
              <p class="quote-text">
                "Content creates interest, but <span class="highlight">empathy builds lasting loyalty</span>."
              </p>
              <span class="quote-author">— Maryem Essam</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Facts Pill Board -->
        <div class="quick-facts-board reveal-item reveal-stagger-2">
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-label">LOCATION</span>
            <span class="fact-value">Egypt (Remote Ready)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-label">COMMUNICATION</span>
            <span class="fact-value">Arabic &amp; English</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-label">FOCUS</span>
            <span class="fact-value">Social Media &amp; Moderation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative & Information Blocks -->
      <div class="about-narrative">
        <div class="lead-paragraph reveal-item reveal-stagger-1">
          <p>
            I believe that great social media isn't just about broadcasting into the void—it is about 
            <strong>sparking genuine dialogue</strong>. As a fresh graduate from the 
            <span class="text-underline">Faculty of Commerce at Benha University</span>, I view every post through both a creative lens and a commercial one.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Four Structured Editorial Information Blocks -->
        <div class="info-blocks-grid">
          <!-- Block 1: Commerce & Business Thinking -->
          <div class="info-block reveal-item reveal-stagger-2">
            <div class="block-badge">01</div>
            <h3 class="block-title">Commercial Foundation</h3>
            <p class="block-text">
              Graduating from the Faculty of Commerce provided me with a firm understanding of consumer decision-making, brand equity, and commercial priorities. I design content that aligns with business objectives.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Block 2: Content Creation Focus -->
          <div class="info-block reveal-item reveal-stagger-3">
            <div class="block-badge">02</div>
            <h3 class="block-title">Content Specialization</h3>
            <p class="block-text">
              Specialized in crafting platform-native social media content. From sharp copy hooks and thoughtful visual concepts to interactive community polls, my focus is keeping audiences engaged and stopping the scroll.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Block 3: Practical SHEIN Sales Experience -->
          <div class="info-block reveal-item reveal-stagger-4">
            <div class="block-badge">03</div>
            <h3 class="block-title">Practical Sales Experience</h3>
            <p class="block-text">
              Through direct sales experience on the SHEIN platform, I navigated high-volume customer inquiries, handled buyer hesitations in real time, and learned how thoughtful customer communication translates into completed checkouts.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Block 4: Marketing Scale Set Certification -->
          <div class="info-block reveal-item reveal-stagger-5">
            <div class="block-badge">04</div>
            <h3 class="block-title">Marketing Scale Set Certified</h3>
            <p class="block-text">
              Trained in strategic audience segmentation, scalable campaign structuring, and metric-aware distribution, ensuring my content decisions are guided by proven marketing methodologies.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Callout Band -->
        <div class="about-callout reveal-item reveal-stagger-4">
          <div class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</div>
          <div class="callout-text">
            <strong>Ready to elevate your online presence?</strong>
            <span>Let's turn your social feeds into active, engaged customer communities.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-sage callout-btn">
            Get In Touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: var(--border-thin);
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .tag-star {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* Grid Layout */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  /* Left Column: Card */
  .about-visual {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .editorial-portrait-card {
    border: var(--border-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-md);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .creator-specimen-box {
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFDF8 0%, #F5EFE3 100%);
    border: var(--border-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .specimen-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .specimen-brand {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .specimen-centerpiece {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .specimen-monogram-seal {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: var(--border-bold);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--color-accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .seal-letters {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .seal-sparkle {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    right: -4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .specimen-name {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .specimen-role-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .specimen-credentials-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .specimen-cred-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cred-icon {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .badge-quote {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: var(--border-thin);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .quote-text .highlight {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .quote-author {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Quick Facts */
  .quick-facts-board {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: var(--border-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-sm);
  }

  .fact-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .fact-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .fact-value {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  /* Right Column: Narrative */
  .about-narrative {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .lead-paragraph p {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .lead-paragraph strong {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .text-underline {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-highlight);
    text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
  }

  /* Info Blocks Grid */
  .info-blocks-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .info-blocks-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .info-block {
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: var(--border-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-sm);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .info-block:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-md);
  }

  .block-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    border: var(--border-thin);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .block-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .block-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Callout Banner */
  .about-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--color-highlight-light);
    border: var(--border-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .callout-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  .callout-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 220px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .callout-text strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .callout-text span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .callout-btn {
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .quick-facts-board {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
